Ancient Warfare 2: Reforged
===========================

Ancient Warfare 2: Reforged is a MODIFIED, UNOFFICIAL port of the Minecraft mod Ancient Warfare 2 to
Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge 21.1 (mod id "ancientwarfare").
It is not made, endorsed or supported by the authors of the original mod.

The original authors are not responsible for this port and are not affiliated with it. Report problems to
https://github.com/Mahd-Labs/AncientWarfare2-Reforged/issues. Credits: CREDITS.md. AI use: AI_DISCLOSURE.md (the port's code was written largely by AI agents).

Modification notice (GNU GPL v3, section 5(a))
----------------------------------------------

This program is a modified version of Ancient Warfare 2 by Shadowmage, P3pp3rF1y and contributors, taken from
P3pp3rF1y/AncientWarfare2 (https://github.com/P3pp3rF1y/AncientWarfare2, branch 1.12.x, commit 446b7db,
21 August 2021). Modified from 13 November 2026 to 17 November 2026:
- all code ported from Minecraft 1.12.2 / Forge to Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge 21.1 (largely by AI agents, see
  AI_DISCLOSURE.md); the five 1.12 mods are one mod with the id "ancientwarfare";
- left out: mobile siege vehicles, boats, battering ram, chest cart, vehicle upgrades and armour;
- added: loading of 1.12 templates and worlds, switchable improvements (each with a config option that restores the
  original behaviour; see README), automated tests;
- removed for licensing: sound files of third-party origin (their sound events are silent) and pixels copied from
  vanilla Minecraft textures (replaced, or the vanilla texture is used); see CREDITS.md;
- display name "Ancient Warfare 2: Reforged".
The source code of every released jar is published at https://github.com/Mahd-Labs/AncientWarfare2-Reforged;
CHANGELOG.md lists the changes.

